{"2753170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Facing Zombie,and 4 Walls", "steam_appid": 2753170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/f9b5611068f0c86ce0ceee3817b7985d.avif?t=1780533453\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras_big/f9b5611068f0c86ce0ceee3817b7985d.avif?t=1780533453 width=800 height=214 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-The Background</h2> In this post apocalyptic land,There are Zombies,Survivors,and other Strange Phenomenon no one can explain.Basically <strong>no where is safe</strong> in this land except for inside <strong>SafetyHouse</strong> ,made by large Corporations.<br>Lucas is one of those Survivors,who has no friends.Can he has to be careful to Survive in this land.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/c91acb4e4d5e345912c451b26f74f1c4.poster.avif?t=1780533453\" width=640 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/c91acb4e4d5e345912c451b26f74f1c4.webm?t=1780533453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/c91acb4e4d5e345912c451b26f74f1c4.mp4?t=1780533453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Game Features</h2>Facing Zombie,and 4 Walls is a single-Player<strong> 3rd person Shooter Zombie Survival Game</strong>.<br><strong>Rule #1</strong>:<br>Stay inside SafetyHouse before 12:00 pm.<br><strong>Rule #2</strong>:<br>Don’t stay in a SafetyHouse that pass it’s Best-before date.<br><strong>Rule #3</strong>:<br>Watch your Step!<br><br>In Game,Player has to Find a Safety House and Live while Dealing with Zombies,Strangers,or other Phenomenons.Player need to Go Around the Land,Searching SafetyHouse,Water and Food,Collect Metals and Wood,Fixing Generators and Lightbolts.Without being Defeated by<strong> Zombies ,or Psychopath Survivors</strong>.<br>The main goal is to<strong> Stay alive as long as Player can be</strong> in The Zombie apocalyptic World,by Following those basic Survival Rules above.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/1882b7611a408eb8b2ef6970d3ee511c.poster.avif?t=1780533453\" width=640 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/1882b7611a408eb8b2ef6970d3ee511c.webm?t=1780533453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/1882b7611a408eb8b2ef6970d3ee511c.mp4?t=1780533453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If Player survive a new day,he will find himself and His house located in Different Location,He has to Explorde nearby Area and Find new House if needed.<br>Good Luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/4446f7497cf23d8a7015ea62cc2eef7f.poster.avif?t=1780533453\" width=640 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/4446f7497cf23d8a7015ea62cc2eef7f.webm?t=1780533453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/4446f7497cf23d8a7015ea62cc2eef7f.mp4?t=1780533453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753170/extras/6e17fbe